    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The emphasis on the shadows is wise. I have already begun the process of distancing myself from my family's residual connections to avoid detection by those who currently hold the titles. However, I am concerned about the digital footprint of our lineage. In this age of absolute surveillance, how can a true sovereign ensure that their eventual emergence is not intercepted or neutralized by the state actors who currently benefit from our absence?",
